# This folder contains published Extent test reports and screenshots
# Run tests and then execute publish_report.bat to copy reports here

## Contents:
- ExtentReport_[timestamp].html - Main test report
- screenshots/ folder - Test execution screenshots (embedded in HTML)
- Supporting files (CSS, JS, JSON)

## Workflow:
1. Run: mvn -Dtest=TestRunner test
2. Run: .\publish_report.bat
3. Open: ExtentReport_*.html in browser

All files are kept together in this single folder (not separated).
